{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7ac2814dd20e3fd3a2e0192d7b798932b8a963ef52a55f53a5f47468bc07423f",
      "text": "Mmm, it smells so sweet and\nnice~... Valentine's Fest makes the\nwhole town feel like candy~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f13e3222aa38e8914e687dfd41df7108401d8705c26093d72be13e2d264ccc1f",
      "text": "S-Stella~. Those people, they're\nhugging~ and kissing~. Hwaaah~...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1094a2a38d420d09c41b11acc5d91f0e3c38ff33b2fc2f98993d3b17ec1a2f99",
      "text": "I believe they are in love.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "16": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:18f63c387b12111050a978e7361a8061c7fb4584f03d5edc65a0b2324a9d236e",
      "text": "When people fall in love,\napparently they want to do that. I\nthink those two became a couple.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "20": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:556dc9017a1c4f39871fe59583b0cae2147b7ab30710373eb44bd31399b61baa",
      "text": "Wowie~... Love... Is that so~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "24": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ad264daa41e7e5b68395b805414574e200b8ffe05d7aa312c79aafcf532c251b",
      "text": "Happy Valentine's! The Guild is\nhanding out sweets★ Help yourselves,\nyou two~!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "28": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fa899d4276574443432d88584a6a0fc475ce9661d2f6cc52c92e4fb54791ece4",
      "text": "Wow~... Everybody's so cute~. All\nsparkly and fluffy~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "32": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:93c779b49688f7979dc3ee38a00db36f3894c589547704f25e53428f143218ff",
      "text": "Feanie, Feanie. Would you like to\nbecome sparkly and fluffy too?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "40": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6ac1810c15cefa4ff225948d1fa78480ff9305691a47e06bac0a46127f30e4ab",
      "text": "Happy Valentine's~. Let's make it a\nlovely Valentine's Fest~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "43": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:68ee9650e7bdae91a827e3bb8c4a2bb606f492c76fe5404d6b4ed25386e61d8e",
      "text": "Lilie~, is this okay~?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "48": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d0653c5d33bcaec08b0f66938f7be6880854db43457a2c527eecd1df0931cc3d",
      "text": "Yes! Thank you for your help! ★ The\noutfit fits perfectly, too!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "52": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f9cd658f89cf33e849ed853e582cc2e58b82d35ade32c08adeeb8e456c810e0d",
      "text": "Ehehe~, thank you~. Feanie's so\nhappy to wear such cute clothes~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "57": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:512a43c3f6d76c95f8a1445ba18fa9e71036d11be6305bdce88838546e037f4b",
      "text": "...C-cu, fl... Cute, it is... So\nvery, very, extremely...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "62": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:855287dfe386e6cd5941bc5e3730f5e73fcab90291f813e03d9e78bb16f3552c",
      "text": "S-Stella? Are you breathing?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "66": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:61348a67a2b459fec8c60bc349e1ac8bf2578a4f34ef6be39a5592f8d83165e5",
      "text": "Valentine's Fest is fun~. Feanie's\nbeing helpful~ ♪",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "69": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4af3b57fce84853e44e487c03aabe5fb7f384f22a880741db310a9f57563d86e",
      "text": "Um, you're Feanie, right? Please!\nMake my love come true!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "72": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e743ba6311fb01aa377a83848cecb01263bc9769c34900fa7a5d38a8abe410ad",
      "text": "Huh...? Feanie, make love come\ntrue~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "75": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6b11a3ac741f9cfd4604758cb433aec989f7cb84dc46acb64f3177235a9a0c3e",
      "text": "I heard you can show people the\nperson they want to meet in a\ndream, right...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "77": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1e3b4fa6d6d56509141f77063f9e13f0477e106416c1941ccfa00d4ed212c666",
      "text": "So I thought maybe, um... I could\npractice confessing!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "79": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:29418a434f07d54d396f3ffc8499c6e5eadac68c96a7407e802da745ea919ce7",
      "text": "T-then me too! I want to rehearse\nfor an important date!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "81": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:130a6fc45b8df05fedf596ac58aa260c4a5b4e2a5506252130c78c56f21d9d87",
      "text": "When I see him, my heart pounds and\nI can't talk right, so...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "84": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2aca0583fc2d84a6e3e1b402570c0b7dcc3756c233993885953d67ec862ed52d",
      "text": "Hwaaa~... Everybody's in love,\nhuh~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "88": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:01924aa4aeaa58efbfaaea2588ab852c7be2bb62b85aadda559fca8125f10581",
      "text": "Okay~. Leave it to Feanie. Feanie\nwill be helpful~ ♪",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "93": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6078ed6b3db803f1a4e70aa385345adffebe25a4bc9eb4fdc28a1355eac6e596",
      "text": "Thank you, Feanie! In the dream, I\ncould confess properly...! I'll do\nmy best on the real day!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "96": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6d8691403b0149ce8929ccc97ddbc75abfce31033b7e562181905cb934b76691",
      "text": "Glad I could help~. Thank you for\nhelping too, Light~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "100": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fef05b12d4d614733a0962557914f1d812438d065538c2a1f1e7f01ca9f5df35",
      "text": "Y-yes. But I'm not sure I was even\nneeded...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "104": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8b781e0cb9687dcd73d7447ddfdcd6566d557d3d61e598be5c94a1a83f7340a7",
      "text": "That's not true~. When Light's with\nme, I can sleep even more soundly~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "107": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:33dd55b10a18d63ab41ae0d997de48f665fdf053bfcb2acb3b2627e3df100ca9",
      "text": "Love is so mysterious~. You like\nsomeone, but you feel uneasy~...? So\nyou want to practice~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "110": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9f82bd7e6edee1961ead53ef3f442ec892d378bb3e9f58e235e7eaee3b87ebae",
      "text": "Will Feanie fall in love with\nsomeone someday~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "113": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9c6d09163946cd6dab0eae515cf9c80528824583dd55e66efed65b745c32d8eb",
      "text": "Um... I heard you can show a dream\nto practice love. Is it already\nover?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "116": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5a48b23a6049f73c150841ec6b7ba40ec8e7d72a85cf0ff4187e0266361bb328",
      "text": "Nope~. If you'd like, we can do a\nsecond round~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "119": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:234e7348ae119d1250b4f38b9c13675932b230f75c1baf864e9374fb215e0d6a",
      "text": "Oh, thank goodness...! Then, here!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "123": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b471d7d6ade7cc6325f7db3e377a6fc11db431a6110a9533e7af93dd7f6fb002",
      "text": "W-what is this pile of paper?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "127": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2197d372c21bc274f85cb1e676f26e2c143374ac4c4aaba4d9c4220cf5606d74",
      "text": "My ultimate ideal boyfriend. Looks,\npersonality, catchphrases, mannerisms,\ntastes... I \"designed\" it all...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "130": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8ac5fe4dc0f36bc0dd47d812c14d5e8cd7b9cd17d3efacdbb4bbbed4eaa75aac",
      "text": "????? Ideal~? Designed...??",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "133": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:74e2e516b2605de6ec0ffcfd61b874402615ccd40a99b8f044faccf97c9d4eb9",
      "text": "Heh heh... Perfection doesn't exist\nin reality. Then I'll make a\nperfect boyfriend myself...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "135": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5bb94db34ad01ded4e6a10a081a55c85aabbfcbca2cbf62318a62d7049aae694",
      "text": "I want to date a handsome adventurer!\nA handsome foreign prince is fine too!\nAnyone, as long as he's handsome—!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "137": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fe6e6b7b0ef18f9ee7e51c6cb3856cc0941e0e01f5e5b38fba35c778b13627aa",
      "text": "Hehehe... He's out of my reach... In\ndreams at least, he'll be all mine...♥\nLock him up, adore him, then—!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "140": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d4a68870b14657a2b9d95d0fa9962c1ef12cc638c3a45c2905ed26a4fb37c668",
      "text": "E-everything ideal~? Anyone\nhandsome is okay~? You like them,\nso you lock them up~...??",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "144": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2b564f06b940b63484064f3329befb3a4dc70a03ff222c00b003cb0c04b359bd",
      "text": "H-hwaaa~~~. My head's getting\nsleepy~, maybe~??",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "149": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1a25a826f814d56dc73dce9b7d0e4d52659370d8fcc71783da35435bd2847b49",
      "text": "Stop! STOOOP! Don't let her hear\nany more of this!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "153": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f64cd06e08303944e56bff7ba460bf71d9f5d110e3032378ed90c995c261f81d",
      "text": "...Light~... Stella~...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "156": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5420bf774370288382d55bea3c96d8551fea3bf2b960dc914fbd31cee53780d8",
      "text": "What is love, anyway~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "160": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f2c6ab6a0bc752798703e565da9fb87d64ebf2125cce8812ea8d4815dc398ba6",
      "text": "It's difficult...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "164": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:00aea386d90106b3edc3f2d14f031362ec94f60a09dc580093fdbc730b18a412",
      "text": "Th-that was a very special case,\nyou know? Don't use it as a\nreference!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "169": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cbf67c8fac9b1b25545a52f718645a6143053e51a28bb8f9662a250d37f9e4d2",
      "text": "I-is that so~? Hmm~...??",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "172": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cc0a2e3a2326e1154d33dba75a9a1564811d167902ff43b653eb22cde8c8494e",
      "text": "Love is hard, huh~... Feanie\ndoesn't really get it, maybe—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "178": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:619a4deb337749cba8bb35f356446f76724447184b51da8996e6a79f58621b3d",
      "text": "...Did Papa and Mama fall in love\ntoo, I wonder~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "181": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0e2cb254b8656af881efb71a0c3098c134a001688a57d2b3a3196dbb98e2b443",
      "text": "Hey, hey, Light, Stella. Have you\ntwo ever been in love~?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "184": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:36b2bd4e383b7274792e8de61699afd99dbaf02ed11ff150be14c2e81211a03b",
      "text": "Feanie wants to know more about\nlove. Then Feanie can be even more\nhelpful, right~?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "188": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b1165d1ccac140b8557b1beff327d9adc70cffc204e1426a7575d1affa8944fe",
      "text": "B-but even if you ask about love,\nin my case... No, never mind.\nThere's nothing to tell—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "193": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7a9a6b06803ca28644773dff18fc20c921cb9dd717992b5908999b4ee0b404eb",
      "text": "Light, I would like to hear.\nPlease.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "198": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8c5bde3023bfc2b4cfa40bf93567e1adc191bc138948d434c840b651a6a2ad73",
      "text": "Stella...?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "203": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a48813b647515fb68b6312b3ad1ce22977c59c48dcefd40922464f2e57001871",
      "text": "Please, Light~. Tell Feanie about\nlove~ ♪",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
